<main>
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>You know claims get shorted. Tidemark finds which ones.</h1>
    <p>Tidemark reads the insurance remittance files your practice already receives and flags the claims that were paid below the fee in your contract.</p>
    <p>It is for the office manager of an independent practice with 2 to 6 chairs, who knows the shortfalls are there and has no hours to check every line of every EOB.</p>
    <div class="ask-row"><a class="commit" data-commitment href="[NEED: checkout link]">Start the pilot for $1,500</a></div>
  </div>
</section>
